[{"id":"playwright-locator-strict","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["Locator","严格模式"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(三)页面元素定位.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(三) 页面元素定位","articlePath":"posts/d5972197/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(三)页面元素定位.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(三) 页面元素定位","articlePath":"posts/d5972197/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>两个订单行都有“删除”按钮，哪种定位最合适？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先按业务身份缩小容器，再定位操作目标，可以消除歧义并保留测试意图。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>直接使用第一个删除按钮\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>使用全页面长 CSS 链\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>先定位目标订单行，再在行内定位删除按钮\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"playwright-trace-purpose","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["TraceViewer","调试"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(十)调试与交付.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(十) 调试与交付","articlePath":"posts/23096463/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(十)调试与交付.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(十) 调试与交付","articlePath":"posts/23096463/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(十二) 项目实战","articlePath":"posts/8141684d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Trace Viewer 最适合回答什么问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>测试执行了什么，以及浏览器在每一步观察到什么。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Trace 将 Action、DOM 快照、网络、Console 和源码关联起来，适合重建失败因果；业务正确仍需明确断言和需求合同。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]